    "html": "<p><span data-math-style=\"display\">m=1</span></p>\n<p>For ,</p>\n<p><span data-math-style=\"display\">sin⁡\\theta =\\frac{m\\lambda }{a}=\\frac{(1)\\left(550\\times {10}^{-6} mm\\right)}{2.5 mm}=2.2\\times {10}^{-4}</span></p>\n<p><span data-math-style=\"display\">\\theta ={sin}^{-1}⁡\\left(2.2\\times {10}^{-4}\\right)=2.2\\times {10}^{-4}rad</span></p>\n<p>The angle is . </p>\n<p>From Eq. 36.1.3,</p>\n<p><span data-math-style=\"display\">\\frac{a}{\\lambda }=\\frac{m}{sin⁡\\theta }=\\frac{1}{sin⁡{45.0}^{\\circ }}=1.41.</span></p>\n",
    "json": "{\"body\":[{\"type\":\"formula\",\"text\":\"m=1\"},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"text\":\"For ,\"},{\"type\":\"formula\",\"text\":\"sin⁡\\\\theta =\\\\frac{m\\\\lambda }{a}=\\\\frac{(1)\\\\left(550\\\\times {10}^{-6} mm\\\\right)}{2.5 mm}=2.2\\\\times {10}^{-4}\"},{\"type\":\"formula\",\"text\":\"\\\\theta ={sin}^{-1}⁡\\\\left(2.2\\\\times {10}^{-4}\\\\right)=2.2\\\\times {10}^{-4}rad\"},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"text\":\"The angle is .\\n\"},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"text\":\"From Eq. 36.1.3,\"},{\"type\":\"formula\",\"text\":\"\\\\frac{a}{\\\\lambda }=\\\\frac{m}{sin⁡\\\\theta }=\\\\frac{1}{sin⁡{45.0}^{\\\\circ }}=1.41.\"}]}",
    "markdown": "$$m=1$$\n\nFor ,\n\n$$sin⁡\\theta =\\frac{m\\lambda }{a}=\\frac{(1)\\left(550\\times {10}^{-6} mm\\right)}{2.5 mm}=2.2\\times {10}^{-4}$$\n\n$$\\theta ={sin}^{-1}⁡\\left(2.2\\times {10}^{-4}\\right)=2.2\\times {10}^{-4}rad$$\n\nThe angle is . \n\nFrom Eq. 36.1.3,\n\n$$\\frac{a}{\\lambda }=\\frac{m}{sin⁡\\theta }=\\frac{1}{sin⁡{45.0}^{\\circ }}=1.41.$$\n",
    "plain": "m=1\n\nFor ,\n\nsin⁡\\theta =\\frac{m\\lambda }{a}=\\frac{(1)\\left(550\\times {10}^{-6} mm\\right)}{2.5 mm}=2.2\\times {10}^{-4}\n\n\\theta ={sin}^{-1}⁡\\left(2.2\\times {10}^{-4}\\right)=2.2\\times {10}^{-4}rad\n\nThe angle is .\n\n\nFrom Eq. 36.1.3,\n\n\\frac{a}{\\lambda }=\\frac{m}{sin⁡\\theta }=\\frac{1}{sin⁡{45.0}^{\\circ }}=1.41."
